m by incorporating the ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Hour Pillar"}]," and establishing the ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Day Master"}]," as the true center of the person."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Today, this system is celebrated for its deep psychological accuracy and has been integrated into career coaching, personal counseling, and life-planning strategies worldwide."}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-4xl mx-auto","children":["$","$Lc",null,{"currentPath":"/bazi-calculator/"}]}]]}]
